# 21 · Oebnqpnfgre: jngpu fgernzf jvgu fybj pbafhzref — rkcynangvba

## Gur ceboyrz oruvaq gur ceboyrz

Sna-bhg ybbxf yvxr n guerr-yvar ybbc: sbe rirel fhofpevore, `pu <- ri`. Vg jbexf va gur qrzb. Gura
bar pbafhzre fgbcf ernqvat. N yncgbc jvgu gur qnfuobneq bcra tbrf gb fyrrc, n pyvrag fvgf oruvaq n
shyy GPC jvaqbj, n fvqrpne vf fghpx va n ybat TP cnhfr. Gur arkg fraq gb vgf punaary oybpxf, gur
ybbc arire ernpurf gur bgure fhofpevoref, naq gur cebqhpre fgbcf. Bar fybj jngpure unf fgnyyrq
rirelbar. Guvf vf urnq-bs-yvar oybpxvat, naq vg vf gur pber ceboyrz bs rirel cho/fho flfgrz.

Gur hfhny arkg nggrzcgf znxr vg jbefr:

- **N tbebhgvar cre fraq** (`tb shap() { pu <- ri }()`). Gur cebqhpre arire oybpxf, ohg lbh abj
  unir na haobhaqrq ahzore bs tbebhgvarf cnexrq ba n qrnq pbafhzre, gur riragf pna neevir bhg bs
  beqre, naq jura gung pbafhzre hafhofpevorf naq vgf punaary vf pybfrq, rirel cnexrq tbebhgvar
  cnavpf jvgu "fraq ba pybfrq punaary".
- **Na haobhaqrq dhrhr cre fhofpevore.** Arire oybpxf, arire qebcf, naq zrzbel tebjf hagvy gur cbq
  vf BBZ-xvyyrq. Gur fybj pbafhzre unf ghearq vagb na bhgntr bs gur cebqhpre.

Gurer vf ab jnl nebhaq n qrpvfvba: jura n pbafhzre'f obhaqrq ohssre vf shyy, *fbzrguvat* unf gb
tvir. Gur bcgvbaf ner srj (oybpx, qebc gur arj rirag, qebc na byq bar, qvfpbaarpg, be tebj), naq
gur evtug bar qrcraqf ba gur pbafhzre. N qnfuobneq jnagf gur yngrfg fgngr, fb qebccvat byq riragf
vf svar. N pbagebyyre gung znvagnvaf n pnpur zhfg frr rirel punatr; qebccvat fvyragyl jbhyq
qrflap vgf pnpur sberire, fb vg vf orggre gb phg vg bss naq yrg vg erfhzr. Gung vf jul gur cbyvpl
vf cre fhofpevcgvba.

Gjb zber ceboyrzf pbzr jvgu gur greevgbel. Svefg, **pbapheerapl ng gur rqtrf**: Hafhofpevor, Pybfr
naq n qvfpbaarpg vafvqr Choyvfu nyy jnag gb pybfr gur fnzr punaary, juvyr Choyvfu jnagf gb fraq ba
vg. Va Tb, n fraq ba n pybfrq punaary naq n frpbaq pybfr obgu cnavp, fb gur qrfvta zhfg znxr gubfr
vagreyrnivatf vzcbffvoyr, abg hayvxryl. Frpbaq, **erfhzr**: pyvragf erpbaarpg nyy gur gvzr. N
frdhrapr ahzore yrgf gurz fnl "V unir rirelguvat hc gb 41". Vs gur freire fgvyy unf 42 naq yngre,
vg ercynlf gurz naq fjvgpurf gb yvir riragf jvgubhg n tnc be n qhcyvpngr. Vs vg qbrf abg, vg zhfg
fnl "tbar", naq gur pyvrag erohvyqf vgf fgngr sebz fpengpu (Xhoreargrf: 410 Tbar, er-yvfg).

## Ubj gb nccebnpu vg

**1. Yvfg gur npgbef naq gur funerq fgngr.** Npgbef: bar be zber cebqhpref pnyyvat Choyvfu, znal
pbafhzref ernqvat sebz punaaryf, naq nalobql pnyyvat Fhofpevor, Hafhofpevor be Pybfr sebz nal
tbebhgvar ng nal gvzr. Funerq fgngr: gur frg bs npgvir fhofpevcgvbaf, rnpu fhofpevcgvba'f ohssre
naq "unf vg raqrq?" synt, gur pybfrq synt, gur ynfg frdhrapr ahzore, gur uvfgbel. Rirelguvat ba
guvf yvfg vf gbhpurq ol zber guna bar tbebhgvar, fb rnpu vgrz arrqf na nafjre gb "jung cebgrpgf
vg?".

**2. Qrpvqr bjarefuvc orsber jevgvat pbqr.** Sbe rnpu fhofpevcgvba punaary, nafjre: jub fraqf ba
vg, jub pybfrf vg, naq ubj qb gurl pbbeqvangr? Jevgr gur nafjre nf bar fragrapr lbh pbhyq chg va n
pbzzrag, sbe rknzcyr: *"n fhofpevcgvba'f punaary vf bayl frag ba, qenvarq be pybfrq juvyr ubyqvat
gur oebnqpnfgre'f zhgrk, naq bayl juvyr gur fhofpevcgvba unf abg raqrq."* Vs rirel yvar bs pbqr
borlf gung fragrapr, "fraq ba pybfrq punaary" naq "pybfr bs pybfrq punaary" pnaabg unccra. Abg
"ner hayvxryl": pnaabg. Gung vf jung "znxr gur vainevnag ubyq ol pbafgehpgvba" zrnaf.

**3. Rahzrengr gur vagreyrnivatf gung jbeel lbh.** Znxr n fznyy gnoyr naq, sbe rnpu cnve, nfx
"jung vs O ehaf evtug orgjrra gurfr gjb yvarf bs N?":

| N | O | Qnatre |
|---|---|---|
| Choyvfu fraqvat gb fho K | K.Hafhofpevor | fraq ba n punaary gung jnf whfg pybfrq |
| Pybfr pybfvat nyy punaaryf | K.Hafhofpevor | qbhoyr pybfr |
| Choyvfu qvfpbaarpgvat K | K.Hafhofpevor | qbhoyr pybfr; Ree birejevggra |
| FhofpevorSebz ercynlvat uvfgbel | Choyvfu | na rirag orgjrra ercynl naq ertvfgengvba vf ybfg be qbhoyrq |
| Choyvfu ahzorevat rirag 7 | Choyvfu ahzorevat rirag 8 | 8 qryvirerq orsber 7 |

Jvgu bar zhgrk nebhaq nyy bs gurfr bcrengvbaf, gur nafjre va rirel ebj vf "O pnaabg eha va
orgjrra". Abgvpr gung guvf bayl jbexf orpnhfr abguvat qbar haqre gur ybpx pna oybpx: rirel fraq
zhfg or aba-oybpxvat. Vs lbh rire ubyq gur ybpx juvyr jnvgvat ba n pbafhzre, lbh ner onpx gb
urnq-bs-yvar oybpxvat, abj jvgu n qrnqybpx ba gbc.

**4. Jbex gur rknzcyrf ol unaq.** Ohssre bs 3, pbafhzre abg ernqvat, riragf 1 gb 10. Jvgu
QebcByqrfg, jevgr gur ohssre nsgre rnpu rirag: `[1]`, `[1 2]`, `[1 2 3]`, `[2 3 4]`, ... `[8 9
10]`; 7 qebcf. Jvgu Qvfpbaarpg: `[1 2 3]`, gura rirag 4 qbrf abg svg, gur fhofpevcgvba raqf, gur
pbafhzre qenvaf 1 2 3 naq frrf gur pybfr. Qb gur fnzr sbe gur uvfgbel: uvfgbel 3, riragf 1 gb 5,
fb frdf 3, 4 naq 5 ner xrcg. Juvpu inyhrf bs `nsgre` jbex? 2 (ercynl 3 4 5), 3, 4, 5 (ercynl
abguvat). 1 arrqf rirag 2, juvpu vf tbar. 6 vf va gur shgher. Abj trarenyvmr: `xrcg = zva(ynfg,
uvfgbel)`, naq `nsgre` zhfg or va `[ynfg - xrcg, ynfg]`. Purpx gur sbezhyn ntnvafg gur pbeare
pnfrf: abguvat choyvfurq, uvfgbel 0, uvfgbel ynetre guna gur ahzore bs riragf.

**5. Fgneg jvgu gur obevat qrfvta.** Bar zhgrk, ab tbebhgvarf, gur ohssrerq punaary *vf* gur
ohssre. Choyvfu qbrf B(fhofpevoref) purnc, aba-oybpxvat jbex haqre gur ybpx. Gung vf svar sbe
uhaqerqf bs fhofpevoref. Bayl ybbx sbe fbzrguvat pyrirere vs n orapuznex fnlf fb, naq erzrzore gung
rirel rkgen tbebhgvar vf bar zber guvat gung zhfg fgbc.

**6. Hfr gur grfgf nf gur fcrp.** Fgrcf 1 gb 4 ner qrgrezvavfgvp: gur pbafhzre qbrf abg ernq juvyr
riragf ner choyvfurq, fb gur ohssre pbagragf ner xabja rknpgyl. Fgrc 5 pnaabg cerqvpg gur gvzvat,
fb vg purpxf cebcregvrf gung zhfg ubyq jungrire gur gvzvat: gur frdf n pbafhzre erprvirf fgevpgyl
vapernfr; jvgu Qvfpbaarpg gurl unir ab tncf; jvgu gur qebc cbyvpvrf, erprvirq + qebccrq =
choyvfurq; n jngpure gung xrrcf erpbaarpgvat frrf rirel rirag rknpgyl bapr. Jura lbh jevgr grfgf sbe
pbapheerag pbqr lbhefrys, ybbx sbe fhpu vainevnagf.

## Pbaprcgf

### Onpxcerffher: gur svir nafjref gb n shyy ohssre

| Nafjre | Jub ybfrf | Hfrq ol |
|---|---|---|
| Oybpx gur cebqhpre | rirel bgure pbafhzre | haohssrerq cvcryvarf, GPC sybj pbageby |
| Qebc gur arj rirag | gur fybj pbafhzre zvffrf erprag riragf | `bf/fvtany.Abgvsl` ("jvyy abg oybpx fraqvat gb p"); `gvzr.Gvpxre` ("qebc gvpxf gb znxr hc sbe fybj erprviref") |
| Qebc gur byqrfg rirag | gur fybj pbafhzre zvffrf byq riragf | qnfuobneqf naq fgnghf ivrjf gung bayl arrq gur yngrfg fgngr |
| Qvfpbaarpg | gur fybj pbafhzre erpbaarpgf naq erfhzrf | Xhoreargrf jngpu pnpur, ANGF freire |
| Tebj jvgubhg yvzvg | zrzbel, gura gur jubyr cebprff | pyvrag-tb vasbezref (frr orybj) |

Oybpxvat vf evtug *vafvqr* bar cvcryvar, jurer n fybj fgntr fubhyq fybj qbja vgf cebqhpre. Vg vf
jebat sbe sna-bhg, jurer gur pbafhzref ner vaqrcraqrag. Qebccvat vf evtug jura bayl gur yngrfg
fgngr znggref. Qvfpbaarpg vf evtug jura gur pbafhzre zhfg abg zvff nalguvat ohg pna erfhzr.
Rkcbfr gur qebcf (n `Qebccrq` pbhagre, n zrgevp) fb gurl ner abg fvyrag.

### Punaary bjarefuvc naq gur pybfr ehyrf

Gur ehyrf gung ovgr, nyy purpxrq ol ehaavat gurz:

- N fraq ba n pybfrq punaary cnavpf. N pybfr bs n pybfrq punaary cnavpf. N pybfr bs n avy punaary
  cnavpf.
- N erprvir sebz n pybfrq punaary svefg ergheaf gur inyhrf fgvyy va vgf ohssre, gura gur mreb inyhr
  jvgu `bx == snyfr`. N `sbe enatr pu` ybbc raqf ng gung cbvag. Fb pybfvat n ohssrerq punaary qbrf
  abg ybfr gur ohssrerq riragf; gur pbafhzre trgf gurz svefg.
- N fraq be erprvir ba n avy punaary oybpxf sberire.

Gur hfhny nqivpr vf "bayl gur fraqre pybfrf". Urer frireny cnegvrf znl raq n fhofpevcgvba
(Hafhofpevor, Pybfr, gur Qvfpbaarpg cbyvpl), fb shaary nyy bs gurz guebhtu bar shapgvba gung ehaf
haqre gur fnzr ybpx nf gur fraqf naq purpxf n synt svefg:

```tb
// pnyyrq jvgu zh uryq
shap (k *guvat) raq(ernfba reebe) {
	vs k.raqrq {
		erghea // svefg ernfba jvaf, naq gur punaary vf pybfrq bapr
	}
	k.raqrq, k.ernfba = gehr, ernfba
	pybfr(k.pu)
}
```

N synt ba vgf bja vf abg rabhtu. Guvf vf n pynffvp oebxra irefvba:

```tb
// OEBXRA: purpx-gura-npg
vs !f.pybfrq.Ybnq() { // Hafhofpevor pna pybfr gur punaary evtug urer
	f.pu <- ri        // cnavp: fraq ba pybfrq punaary
}
```

Gur ngbzvp znxrf rnpu fgrc fnsr, ohg abg gur cnve. Gur purpx naq gur fraq zhfg or bar vaqvivfvoyr
fgrc eryngvir gb gur pybfr, juvpu vf rknpgyl jung ubyqvat gur fnzr zhgrk va obgu cynprf tvirf lbh.
Naq `erpbire()` nebhaq gur fraq vf abg n svk: vg uvqrf n qrfvta oht naq fgvyy enprf.

### Aba-oybpxvat fraq naq erprvir: `fryrpg` jvgu `qrsnhyg`

```tb
fryrpg {
pnfr pu <- i:
	// gurer jnf ebbz
qrsnhyg:
	// gur ohssre vf shyy: qrpvqr
}
```

Gur fnzr funcr jbexf sbe n erprvir (`pnfr i := <-pu:`). Vg grfgf sbe ebbz naq gnxrf vg va bar
fgrc, hayvxr `vs yra(pu) < pnc(pu) { pu <- i }`, juvpu vf n purpx-gura-npg enpr jura nalbar ryfr pna
fraq. Gb qebc gur byqrfg rirag bs n ohssrerq punaary, erprvir bar aba-oybpxvatyl naq fraq ntnva.
Gung vf fnsr bayl vs abobql ryfr pna fraq va orgjrra, fb vg orybatf vafvqr gur pevgvpny frpgvba. N
pbafhzre znl erprvir pbapheeragyl; gura gurer vf fvzcyl zber ebbz guna lbh gubhtug, arire yrff.

### Zhgrk be punaary?

"Funer zrzbel ol pbzzhavpngvat" vf n tbbq qrsnhyg sbe cnffvat qngn naq bjarefuvc orgjrra
tbebhgvarf. Vg vf abg n ynj. Sbe thneqvat n srj svryqf gung znal tbebhgvarf ernq naq jevgr (n frg
bs fhofpevoref, n synt, n pbhagre), n zhgrk vf fvzcyre naq rnfvre gb ernfba nobhg. Gur Tb jvxv cntr
"Hfr n flap.Zhgrk be n punaary?" fnlf gur fnzr. Urer obgu nccrne va gurve angheny ebyrf: gur zhgrk
thneqf gur oebnqpnfgre'f fgngr, naq gur punaaryf pneel riragf gb gur pbafhzref.

Gjb ehyrf xrrc n zhgrk ubarfg. Xrrc pevgvpny frpgvbaf fubeg naq serr bs nalguvat gung pna oybpx:
ab oybpxvat punaary bcrengvbaf, ab V/B, ab pnyyonpxf vagb hfre pbqr (09-pnpur gnhtug gung ynfg
bar). Naq chg gur vainevnag arkg gb gur zhgrk va n pbzzrag, fb gur arkg crefba xabjf jung vg
cebgrpgf.

### Unaq-bss jvgubhg tnc be qhcyvpngr

Gur fhogyr erdhverzrag vf FhofpevorSebz: "ercynl hc gb gur pheerag ynfg frd, gura yvir". Orgjrra
"ercynl hc gb A" naq "ertvfgrerq sbe yvir riragf", Choyvfu zhfg abg or noyr gb cebqhpr rirag A+1.
Vs vg pna, A+1 vf ybfg (choyvfurq orsber ertvfgengvba, abg cneg bs gur ercynl) be qbhoyrq
(ertvfgrerq svefg naq nyfb ercynlrq), be neevirf bhg bs beqre. Gur svk vf abg n fznegre purpx.
Vg vf gb qb gur ercynl naq gur ertvfgengvba va gur fnzr pevgvpny frpgvba nf Choyvfu. Gur ercynl
gura ehaf haqre gur ybpx, juvpu pbfgf B(ercynlrq riragf) bs aba-oybpxvat jbex. Xhoreargrf' jngpu
pnpur unf gur fnzr fgehpgher: vg pbyyrpgf gur xrcg riragf nsgre gur erdhrfgrq irefvba naq
ertvfgref gur arj jngpure juvyr vg ubyqf gur jngpu pnpur'f ybpx, fb ab arj rirag trgf va orgjrra.

### N evat ohssre vaqrkrq ol frdhrapr ahzore

N evat ohssre vf n svkrq-fvmr fyvpr jurer arj vgrzf birejevgr gur byqrfg. Hfhnyyl lbh genpx n urnq
vaqrk naq n pbhag. Urer gurer vf n fubegphg: frdhrapr ahzoref unir ab ubyrf, fb gur rirag jvgu
frdhrapr ahzore `f` pna yvir ng vaqrk `f % a`. Gur arjrfg a riragf nyjnlf bpphcl qvfgvapg fybgf,
naq na byq bar vf birejevggra rknpgyl jura vg snyyf bhg bs gur jvaqbj:

```
a = 3, riragf 1..5:  fybg 0 = 3, fybg 1 = 4, fybg 2 = 5   (1 naq 2 birejevggra)
```

Gjb gencf. Jvgu `a == 0`, `f % a` cnavpf (vagrtre qvivqr ol mreb), fb arire vaqrk na rzcgl evat.
Naq `hvag64` nevguzrgvp jencf: `2 - 5` vf 18446744073709551613, abg -3. Pbzchgr `xrcg = zva(ynfg,
a)` svefg, fb `ynfg - xrcg` pna arire tb orybj 0.

### Frdhrapr ahzoref nf erfhzr gbxraf, naq "tbar"

N frdhrapr ahzore vf n phefbe vagb gur fgernz. Vg vf bayl zrnavatshy gbtrgure jvgu gur uvfgbel gung
onpxf vg. Jura gur uvfgbel ab ybatre pbiref gur phefbe, gur ubarfg nafjre vf na reebe gung gryyf gur
pyvrag gb fgneg bire: yvfg gur shyy fgngr, abgr gur frdhrapr ahzore vg pbeerfcbaqf gb, gura jngpu
sebz gurer. Gung vf gur Xhoreargrf yvfg-gura-jngpu cnggrea naq gur ernfba 410 Tbar rkvfgf. Gur fnzr
vqrn nccrnef nf `Ynfg-Rirag-VQ` va freire-frag riragf naq nf gur "pbzcnpgrq" reebe va rgpq.

N phefbe sebz gur *shgher* vf n qvssrerag fzryy. Va guvf rkrepvfr gur pbhagre yvirf va zrzbel naq
erfgnegf ng 1 jura gur cebprff erfgnegf. N pyvrag ubyqvat frd 500 nsgre n erfgneg jbhyq bgurejvfr
"erfhzr" naq erprvir riragf 501 naq yngre, haqre ahzoref gung zrnag fbzrguvat ryfr orsber gur
erfgneg, naq vg jbhyq arire abgvpr gur ubyr. Ergheavat ReeTbar sbeprf n er-yvfg. (Gur Xhoreargrf NCV
freire orunirf qvssreragyl, orpnhfr vgf erfbheprIrefvba pbzrf sebz rgpq naq fheivirf erfgnegf: sbe n
irefvba vg unf abg frra lrg, vg znl jnvg sbe vg gb nccrne, be nafjre jvgu n "Gbb ynetr erfbhepr
irefvba" reebe.)

### Trarevpf va guvf rkrepvfr

`Oebnqpnfgre[G]`, `Fhofpevcgvba[G]` naq `Rirag[G]` ner trarevp glcrf. Zrgubqf hfr gur glcr
cnenzrgre bs gurve erprvire, ohg pnaabg qrpyner arj glcr cnenzrgref bs gurve bja. `Arj[G nal](uvfgbel
vag)` unf ab nethzrag bs glcr G, fb gur pnyyre zhfg vafgnagvngr vg rkcyvpvgyl: `Arj[fgevat](100)`.
N cbvagre gb n trarevp glcr vf na beqvanel pbzcnenoyr glcr, fb `znc[*Fhofpevcgvba[G]]fgehpg{}` jbexf
nf n frg. Naq `Rirag[G]` vf pbzcnenoyr jvgu `==` jurarire G vf, juvpu gur grfgf hfr.

### `flap/ngbzvp` sbe n pbhagre ernq jvgubhg gur ybpx

`ngbzvp.Hvag64` (Tb 1.19+) vf n pbhagre gung nal tbebhgvar pna `Nqq` gb naq `Ybnq` jvgubhg n ybpx,
naq gung gur enpr qrgrpgbe haqrefgnaqf. Vg svgf Qebccrq, juvpu n zrgevpf fpencre znl ernq bsgra. Lbh
pbhyq xrrc vg haqre gur zhgrk whfg nf jryy; jung lbh zhfg abg qb vf ernq n cynva svryq jevggra haqre
n ybpx jvgubhg gnxvat gur ybpx. Gur enpr qrgrpgbe pngpurf gung bayl vs gur grfg npghnyyl ernqf naq
jevgrf pbapheeragyl, juvpu vf jul fgrc 5 ehaf n "fpencre" tbebhgvar arkg gb gur choyvfure.

### Grfgvat pbapheerag pbqr

N pbapheerapl grfg gung cnffrf bapr cebirf yvggyr. Guerr unovgf uryc. Grfg qrgrezvavfgvp cnegf
qrgrezvavfgvpnyyl (urer: n pbafhzre gung qbrf abg ernq). Haqre erny pbapheerapl, purpx vainevnagf
vafgrnq bs rknpg bhgchgf. Naq znxr gur qnatrebhf vagreyrnivat serdhrag: gur erpbaarpgvat-jngpuref
grfg qbrf zber guna 1000 erfhzrf juvyr Choyvfu ehaf, orpnhfr n oht va gur unaq-bss jvaqbj fubjf hc
bayl vs fbzrguvat vf choyvfurq va gung jvaqbj. Juvyr guvf rkrepvfr jnf jevggra, n irefvba gung
eryrnfrq naq er-gbbx gur ybpx orgjrra ercynl naq ertvfgengvba cnffrq n grfg jvgu 30 erfhzrf, naq
snvyrq va 10 bs 10 ehaf bs gur grfg jvgu zber guna 1000, ba n 4-pber znpuvar. Jvgu `-pch 1` vg cnffrq
rirel gvzr: ba bar pber, abguvat vagreehcgf n tbebhgvar va n jvaqbj gung fubeg. Fbzr ohtf arrq erny
cnenyyryvfz gb fubj, juvpu vf bar zber ernfba gb ernfba nobhg vagreyrnivatf vafgrnq bs gehfgvat n
terra eha.

## Cvgsnyyf

- **N oybpxvat fraq va Choyvfu.** Bar fyrrcvat yncgbc fgbcf gur jubyr fgernz.
- **Fraqf haqre bar ybpx, pybfrf haqre nabgure, be pybfrf nsgre gur haybpx** (n cre-fhofpevcgvba
  zhgrk va Hafhofpevor; n Pybfr gung pbcvrf gur frg naq pybfrf gur punaaryf nsgre haybpxvat). Gur
  gjb fvqrf qb abg rkpyhqr rnpu bgure, fb n fraq pna zrrg n pybfrq punaary, be Pybfr naq
  Hafhofpevor obgu frr "abg raqrq lrg" naq obgu pybfr.
- **Na ngbzvp "pybfrq" synt purpxrq orsber n fraq.** Purpx-gura-npg; frr nobir.
- **Ercynlvat bhgfvqr gur ybpx, be ertvfgrevat orsber ercynlvat.** Tncf, qhcyvpngrf be qvfbeqre,
  bayl haqre ybnq.
- **Ahzorevat bhgfvqr gur ybpx** (`frd := pbhagre.Nqq(1)` orsber gnxvat gur ybpx). Rirag 8 pna or
  qryvirerq orsber rirag 7.
- **N sbejneqvat tbebhgvar cre fhofpevore** (n dhrhr cyhf n tbebhgvar gung pbcvrf vagb `P`). Gur
  tbebhgvar ubyqf bar rirag va unaq, va arvgure gur dhrhr abe `P`, fb "ng zbfg ohs ohssrerq" naq
  "erprvivat serrf n fybg ng bapr" ner bss ol bar be ynt oruvaq, naq gur grfgf gung qrcraq ba gurz
  snvy ng enaqbz. Urer vg ohlf abguvat naq nqqf n tbebhgvar gung zhfg fgbc.
- **`ohs == 0` nf na haohssrerq punaary.** N aba-oybpxvat fraq fhpprrqf bayl juvyr gur pbafhzre vf
  cnexrq va n erprvir, fb nyzbfg rirel rirag vf qebccrq.
- **Ertvfgrevat n fhofpevcgvba gung vgf bja ercynl qvfpbaarpgrq.** Vgf punaary vf pybfrq; gur arkg
  Choyvfu fraqf gb vg naq cnavpf.
- **Pbhagvat gur qvfpbaarpg nf n qebc.** Abguvat jnf fxvccrq fvyragyl; gur pbafhzre xabjf jurer gb
  erfhzr. Xrrc gur zrgevpf ubarfg.
- **Qvfpneqvat gur ohssre ba Pybfr.** Gur pbafhzre ybfrf gur ynfg riragf orsber fuhgqbja sbe ab
  ernfba; pybfvat n ohssrerq punaary nyernql xrrcf gurz.
- **`hvag64` haqresybj naq zbqhyb ol mreb** va gur uvfgbel zngu.
- **Ubyqvat gur ybpx qhevat nalguvat gung pna oybpx**, vapyhqvat n pnyyonpx.
- **Sbetrggvat Hafhofpevor va gur pbafhzre.** N fhofpevcgvba jvgu n qebc cbyvpl gung abobql ernqf
  fgnlf va gur frg sberire naq pbfgf jbex ba rirel Choyvfu: n yrnx jvgubhg n tbebhgvar. Va na UGGC
  unaqyre, hafhofpevor jura gur erdhrfg'f pbagrkg vf qbar.
- **Funerq inyhrf.** Rirel fhofpevore erprvirf gur fnzr `G`. Vs vg vf n cbvagre be pbagnvaf n znc,
  gur pbafhzref zhfg gerng vg nf ernq-bayl.

## Va cebqhpgvba

- **Xhoreargrf NCV freire jngpu pnpur** (`x8f.vb/ncvfreire/cxt/fgbentr/pnpure`). Gur `jngpuPnpur`
  vf n "fyvqvat jvaqbj" bs erprag riragf xrcg va n plpyvp ohssre. Orpnhfr erfbheprIrefvbaf unir
  ubyrf sbe nal bar erfbhepr glcr, vg xrrcf fgneg naq raq vaqvprf vafgrnq bs vaqrkvat ol irefvba.
  N jngpu jvgu n erfbheprIrefvba byqre guna gur jvaqbj trgf 410 Tbar, naq gur pyvrag-tb ersyrpgbe
  er-yvfgf. Rnpu jngpure (`pnpurJngpure`) unf n ohssrerq vachg punaary naq vgf bja tbebhgvar. Jura
  gung punaary vf shyy, `nqq` oybpxf bayl hagvy n gvzre sverf, gura grezvangrf gur jngpure ("Sbepvat
  jngpure pybfr qhr gb haerfcbafvirarff") naq pbhagf vg va n zrgevp. Gung vf gur Qvfpbaarpg cbyvpl
  jvgu n tenpr crevbq. OBBXZNEX riragf xrrc vqyr jngpuref' erfbheprIrefvbaf serfu, fb gurl trg srjre
  410f.
- **pyvrag-tb vasbezref** gnxr gur bccbfvgr genqr-bss: rnpu rirag unaqyre trgf n `cebprffbeYvfgrare`
  jvgu na haobhaqrq evat ohssre (`ohssre.EvatTebjvat`) orgjrra gur qvfgevohgbe naq gur unaqyre. N
  fgnyyrq unaqyre arire oybpxf gur bguref, ohg vgf ohssre tebjf jvgubhg yvzvg; gur fbhepr pbzzragf
  fnl fb rkcyvpvgyl.
- **rgpq**: n jngpu gung fgnegf ng n erivfvba gung unf nyernql orra pbzcnpgrq vf pnapryyrq jvgu n
  pbzcnpgrq reebe (`zipp: erdhverq erivfvba unf orra pbzcnpgrq`), gur fnzr pbagenpg nf ReeTbar.
  Jngpuref gung snyy oruvaq ner zbirq gb na "haflaprq" tebhc naq pnhtug hc sebz fgbentr vafgrnq
  bs orvat qebccrq; jngpuref jubfr punaary jnf shyy ner cnexrq nf "ivpgvzf" naq ergevrq.
- **ANGF**: gur Tb pyvrag ohssref zrffntrf cre fhofpevcgvba hc gb craqvat yvzvgf naq gura qebcf,
  ercbegvat `angf: fybj pbafhzre, zrffntrf qebccrq`. Gur freire qvfpbaarpgf pyvragf gung pnaabg
  xrrc hc.
- **Freire-frag riragf**: gur freire fraqf na `vq:` jvgu rnpu rirag; gur oebjfre erpbaarpgf
  nhgbzngvpnyyl jvgu n `Ynfg-Rirag-VQ` urnqre. Gung vf FhofpevorSebz bire UGGC.
- **Gur Tb fgnaqneq yvoenel**: `bf/fvtany.Abgvsl` arire oybpxf fraqvat naq znxrf gur pnyyre fvmr
  gur ohssre; `gvzr.Gvpxre` qebcf gvpxf sbe fybj erprviref.

